# --- Platforms this game does not ship on ---------------------------------
# Android and iOS only. The desktop and web scaffolding that `flutter create`
# generates is not part of the product: the arena is a fixed portrait board
# sized for a phone, the controls are touch drags, and none of that has an
# answer on a desktop window.
linux/
macos/
windows/
web/

# --- Local working files, not part of the product -------------------------
*.log
.env
.env.*
